" end="00:17.247">I </span><span begin="00:17.247" end="00:17.522">know </span><span begin="00:17.522" end="00:18.003">it's </span><span begin="00:18.003" end="00:18.471">been </span><span begin="00:18.471" end="00:18.758">a </span><span begin="00:18.758" end="00:19.273">while</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.279" end="00:21.109"><span begin="00:19.279" end="00:19.545">But </span><span begin="00:19.545" end="00:19.824">I'm </span><span begin="00:19.824" end="00:20.327">glad </span><span begin="00:20.327" end="00:20.566">you </span><span begin="00:20.566" end="00:21.109">came</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.139" end="00:23.107"><span begin="00:21.139" end="00:21.331">And </span><span begin="00:21.331" end="00:21.522">I've </span><span begin="00:21.522" end="00:22.121">been </span><span begin="00:22.121" end="00:22.764">thinking </span><span begin="00:22.764" end="00:23.107">'bout</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.377" end="00:25.168"><span begin="00:23.377" end="00:23.619">How </span><span begin="00:23.619" end="00:23.874">you </span><span begin="00:23.874" end="00:24.345">say </span><span begin="00:24.345" end="00:24.656">my </span><span begin="00:24.656" end="00:25.168">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.173" end="00:29.225"><span begin="00:25.173" end="00:25.388">You </span><span begin="00:25.388" end="00:25.615">got </span><span begin="00:25.615" end="00:26.158">my </span><span begin="00:26.158" end="00:26.797">body </span><span begin="00:26.797" end="00:27.458">spinning </span><span begin="00:27.458" end="00:27.760">like </span><span begin="00:27.760" end="00:27.972">a </span><span begin="00:27.972" end="00:29.225">hurricane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.233" end="00:32.270"><span begin="00:29.233" end="00:29.440">And </span><span begin="00:29.440" end="00:29.665">it </span><span begin="00:29.665" end="00:29.976">feels </span><span begin="00:29.976" end="00:30.228">like </span><span begin="00:30.228" end="00:30.531">